  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroManager
  dialogueText: {fileID: 0}
  nextSceneName: main
  introLines:
  - 'The year is 2056, the nations, including whole UK, are in shambles.

'
  - Out of all possible canditates we found you the most suitable for the job that
    awaits you, that being going back in time to fix this mess we call present time.
  - 'THAT''S RIGHT you''re going back in time, to to take care of relationship between
    Poland and Germany, to (hopefully) smooth things over.

'
  - 'What? Are you asking me how will that effect our time continuum, cause paradoxes?

'
  - We don't have time for that! Get in the machine and help avert the crisis!
